codex
The full-covariance candidate passed local syntax validation and is in the blackbox run. Its logical cost is only about 1.1 billion matrix FLOPs per MLP—well below the 27.2-billion floor where the score multiplier first rises—so the key question from this run is whether wall-time accounting remains under that same floor.
