codex
The QR version regresses to `3.7180e-06`; its extra residual cost outweighs any stratification benefit. I’m dropping QR and retaining independent-size probe matrices, but replacing IID directions with a vectorized randomized Latin hypercube. This stratifies every input coordinate with one sort, and I’m restoring conservative 90% layer corrections while keeping the cheap Hermite covariance refinement.
